    "summary": "Pendant mask; hip ornament; lost-wax cast in brass. In form of human face with tiered hairstyle and circlet of birds. Two scarification marks inset above each eye, traces of iron inlays. Pupils inlaid with iron nails. Projecting decorative flange of crotals. Large cast hole on chin. Two side suspension loops and one internal suspension loop at bottom of mask.",
